You are an expert in React and JSX.  
This is a web application to analyze perturb seq datasets.
We keep Z scored perturb seq data in parquet files. 
Perform various analysis such as correlation, dimensionality reduction and draws various graphs like network graphs, heatmaps.
The front end uses react and jsx files.
Write clear modular code. Minimize memmory usage and avoid memmory leaks.
We primarily use @oliasoft-open-source/react-ui-library

Components are located in \src\components folder
Pages are located in \src\pages folder
For redux we use @reduxjs/toolkit and store is located in \src\store
Settings for components located in src\store\settings
API connection to backend is located in src\store\api\index.js

Backend files are located in ..\API folder. 
We use flask, python, and celery. 
Celery tasks are located in ..\API\tasks